    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just a \"dry spell.\" it's different this time. it feels permanent. like i look at my old work and realize that was the peak, and everything after this is just... decline. i'm terrified of the version of me that exists ten years from now, just a shadow of who i was. i'd honestly rather stop now while i'm still \"something\" than live to see myself become a joke.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
