      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your fear of permanent decline stems from mistaking current burnout for a true end of your potential. You are not a shadow yet; your life is simply full of untested possibilities that haven't been carved out over the last few months. Choosing to stop now would feel like a betrayal of the very creative self you are terrified to lose. Sometimes the bravest thing a creator does is endure the pain of revision to find a new peak that was waiting beneath the old one.",
      "source": "target",
